 "about_text": "The Landing is a fine art gallery in Los Angeles specializing in historically significant twentieth-century postwar works, with particular attention to art made in California, alongside a program of contemporary artists. Operating from a 2,800-square-foot space on Jefferson Boulevard, the gallery presents a rotating schedule of solo, two-person, and thematic group exhibitions. It represents a roster that spans both historical and living artists, bridging mid-century West Coast art history with current practice. The gallery is led by owner Gerard O'Brien and participates regularly in major art fairs across the United States.",
